# Local leak-guard: ALL soccer domain data (raw downloads, parquets, odds) stays
# private/untracked. Avoids touching the human-gated root .gitignore (P0-A-001).
# Price-bearing (odds-derived) artifacts + football-data.co.uk source data -> nothing
# here goes public. This nested guard is INDEPENDENT of the root .gitignore so it
# remains effective whether or not P0-A-001 has been committed.
*
!.gitignore
